# The Raspberry Pi 4's bootstrap (docs/design-stopgap.md, "The Raspberry Pi 4"):
# Fiasco's generic platform, whose RAM starts at 0, with the 16550 family's drivers for the
# mini UART beside the PL011's. bootstrap links static at its load address
# (Makefile.platform); BID_PIE_VOLUNTARY, Kconfig's default and QEMU virt's too, only
# satisfies the platform's check in mk/platforms/arm_gen.conf.
CONFIG_BUILD_ARCH_arm64=y
CONFIG_PLATFORM_TYPE_arm_gen=y
CONFIG_BID_PIE_VOLUNTARY=y
CONFIG_BID_GENERATE_MAPFILE=y
CONFIG_DRIVERS_FRST_UART_DRV_PL011=y
CONFIG_DRIVERS_FRST_UART_DRV_8250=y
# CONFIG_DRIVERS_FRST_UART_ALL_DRIVERS is not set
# CONFIG_BID_BUILD_DOC is not set
# CONFIG_BID_BUILD_TESTS is not set
